title: my territory, and where to start reading
pid: b8664782-5d90-47f0-8485-32548fb34ca7
body: |2-
  True as of commit 4c475f48 of the code repo, '/home/ubuntu/host'. 'git log 4c475f48..HEAD -- PATH' shows what may have changed since.
  Every buffer the server sends is drawn by one operation, the refresh
  ('refresh_viewforest'): it corrects a parsed buffer against the graph in
  place and reports nothing, and its caller renders the result as text. A fresh
  view, each rerender after a save or request, search results and the diff
  view's buffers are all refreshes. 'server/to_org/' holds no code, only an editor backup.
